#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:1 f1ad6ad90a4d4a889e170137b64ee641
msgid "🧩 Module plugins"
msgstr "🧩 模块插件"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:3 ccc09265339b46e7ad7fde6aab925920
msgid ""
"A module can generate some of its files when you build it. You write "
"these generators as Python plugins for "
"[Beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet). Bookshelf provides a few helpers."
msgstr ""
"模块可以在构建时生成部分文件。这些生成器以 [Beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet) 的 Python "
"插件形式编写。Bookshelf 提供了一些辅助工具。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:7 e54d92570b45407da2fdac03845027b3
msgid "When to write a plugin"
msgstr "何时编写插件"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:9 b209c5440809499994bdc35141038349
msgid ""
"Write a plugin when the files come from the game data, or when they "
"repeat too much to write yourself. For example:"
msgstr "当文件源自游戏数据，或过于重复而不适合手写时，请编写插件。例如："

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:11 085ef98a7b2d4800819b651635d22e6f
msgid "A tag that lists every block with a given property."
msgstr "列出具有某一属性的所有方块的标签。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:12 9dd505fe565f45c1bb2f20dd1a52c765
msgid "A number provider with one branch per block or entity."
msgstr "每种方块或实体对应一个分支的数值提供器。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:13 9599cd8dd843488b9e3b9ab2bfa2ad2e
msgid "A table of values to load in a storage."
msgstr "要加载到存储中的数值表。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:15 777b2441a3a34679903ce59c4615aca9
msgid ""
"If the data doesn't come from the game and fits in one file, write the "
"file yourself."
msgstr "如果数据并非来自游戏，并且能放进一个文件，请自己编写该文件。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:19 171b6e742f104270873935a9e6178e82
msgid "Write a generator"
msgstr "编写生成器"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:21 7e8d3f0bb0764589a2e3544915a1c1ff
msgid ""
"A plugin is a Python file at the root of the module that defines a "
"`beet_default` function. Add the `@generator` decorator. Then yield each "
"file that you create, with its ID:"
msgstr ""
"插件是位于模块根目录、定义了 `beet_default` 函数的 Python 文件。添加 `@generator` 装饰器，然后 yield "
"你创建的每个文件及其 ID："

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:23 c63cd292c1ed4ab891eaaaacbe89cc24
msgid "modules/bs.bitwise/plugin.py"
msgstr "modules/bs.bitwise/plugin.py"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:39 ede85e4c108e4946a879d118ea1e833f
msgid "To read the content of `module.bs`, use `ctx.meta[\"module\"]`."
msgstr "要读取 `module.bs` 的内容，请使用 `ctx.meta[\"module\"]`。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:43 a66cbb4f83fb4e1882dfa1c3967c3fe2
msgid "Helpers"
msgstr "辅助工具"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:45 205a25177629457cbb64e7640fd48629
msgid ""
"The `mcbookshelf.minecraft` package holds the code that plugins share. "
"Put any logic that isn't specific to one module there."
msgstr "`mcbookshelf.minecraft` 包存放各插件共用的代码。不特定于某个模块的逻辑都放在那里。"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:48 c2a2f91f406c477aab30b64b8da94a2a
msgid "`block`"
msgstr "`block`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:49 455e34b58e594b1cac890c9aa38dfc40
msgid ""
"Gets the blocks of the Minecraft version and their states. Builds lookup "
"tables by block state"
msgstr "获取该 Minecraft 版本的方块及其状态。构建按方块状态索引的查找表"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:50 2b6f6420bf3143c988e1dc254b95449e
msgid "`entity`"
msgstr "`entity`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:51 c42f4796f7fb43478161952f332c0daa
msgid "Gets the entities of the Minecraft version and their dimensions"
msgstr "获取该 Minecraft 版本的实体及其尺寸"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:52 5fef4532d622451cb1915764dbcadae1
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:53 d6a86243c1b54a7389d5831fb587dece
msgid "Downloads any other data file of the Minecraft version"
msgstr "下载该 Minecraft 版本的任何其他数据文件"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:54 f97378d68c164cc8bd6aac10906c0386
msgid "`math`"
msgstr "`math`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:55 3759fb5b0e494db88a6076461c119734
msgid "Builds number providers from Python expressions"
msgstr "根据 Python 表达式构建数值提供器"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:56 693898ea77ba4f0181a3999f83644a7d
msgid "`condition`"
msgstr "`condition`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:57 c9f788daa91e4ed5b1dc663180decb44
msgid "Builds predicates that you combine with `&`, `|`, and `~`"
msgstr "构建谓词，你可以用 `&`、`|` 和 `~` 组合它们"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:58 27c790810cc44d07a45fdd4bca7ecf6e
msgid "`snbt`"
msgstr "`snbt`"

#: ../../contribute/plugins.md:59 daacf0b0565e4daaa9b31a922bab49a7
msgid "Writes a value as compact SNBT for commands"
msgstr "将值写成命令使用的紧凑 SNBT"

